      "side": 1,
      "message": "They are not flag bits from the public API, but they are used as enum bits internally. Unfortunately SkEnumBitmask is set up to expect the enum values to already be shifted.  But I\u0027ve often thought it would be nice if it could auto-shift the values to make mask enum declarations simpler, so maybe I\u0027ll see how hard that change is first, and will either just change these to decimal values or have them use the packed values.",
